  "description": "High-performance similarity search and clustering of dense vectors. A from-scratch .NET port of FAISS — no native binaries, no P/Invoke — built on Span<T> and SIMD intrinsics, with an API shaped like Python FAISS. Flat, IVF, HNSW, PQ, scalar-quantized and binary indexes, with versioned persistence and memory-mapped search.",
