  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: fixes synced from upstream FAISS 1.15.x. HNSW no longer misreads its visited table after the table grows, and parallel insertion reads the entry point and top level atomically. IndexShards supports RemoveIds and rejects a shard with a different metric; IndexReplicas supports predicate removal. k-means++ seeding runs in parallel. New package icon.",
